A whole-brain analysis was conducted for every contrast between conditions. A second-level analysis used contrasts from the first-level and one-sample tests to investigate group-level activation. In addition, the score of personality questionnaires was included as multiple regression to identify the effect of individual differences on brain activity in selected, and non-selected, brain activity. The initial uncorrected voxel threshold was set to p
